                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#e15759' fontsize='10'>The QC Analytics Team is building out a new suite of pandora Dashboards using new pandora Sources of Truth. During this time, legacy dashboards will NOT be migrated.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#e15759' fontsize='10'>Please note that our pandora Interim Performance Dashboard is the source of truth: </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4996b2' fontsize='10' hyperlink='tabdoc:load-url url=&amp;quot;https://lookerstudio.google.com/reporting/86269922-27ef-44c9-b59b-588510410068/page/ED8QE&amp;quot;'>https://lookerstudio.google.com/reporting/86269922-27ef-44c9-b59b-588510410068/page/ED8QE</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='8' italic='true'>Note: Please select only 1 country when viewing local currency!</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='8' italic='true'>Note: Total and Existing Customers are overstated. Please do not quote numbers from this dashboard.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='8' italic='true'>Note: New Customers numbers may be unavailable for D-1</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
